{"v":1,"id":"8780ccf144f1","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"Morning comes, but my heart runs","s":12.82,"e":18.6},{"t":"Chasing every little thing that isn't you","s":20.02,"e":25.48},{"t":"I forget every promise","s":26.82,"e":32.84},{"t":"Till the weight of all my wandering pulls me through","s":33.76,"e":41.18},{"t":"I remember how you found me crying on my bedroom floor","s":41.18,"e":48.62},{"t":"Calling from the shadows","s":48.62,"e":52.32},{"t":"You opened up the door","s":52.32,"e":55.72},{"t":"Daily I need You","s":57.16,"e":59.98},{"t":"More than my breath","s":59.98,"e":62.8},{"t":"More than the strength","s":64.1,"e":66.3},{"t":"I pretend that I have left","s":66.84,"e":70.18},{"t":"I'm sorry I leave You","s":70.18,"e":74.24},{"t":"When I'm afraid","s":74.24,"e":76.84},{"t":"Teach me to stay","s":78.08,"e":80.44},{"t":"To stay in Your presence each day","s":80.96,"e":84.4},{"t":"Lord, I need You","s":85.16,"e":87.98},{"t":"Daily I need You","s":87.98,"e":92.36},{"t":"I've been proud, I've been stubborn Tried to carry what You said to lay down","s":106.84,"e":119.1},{"t":"I've been lost in the noise Till Your whisper is the only holy sound","s":120.64,"e":133.18},{"t":"Creating me a clean heart","s":135.78,"e":139.12},{"t":"Like the words I used to sing","s":139.12,"e":142.04},{"t":"Restore to me the joy, Lord","s":143.12,"e":146.16},{"t":"Of being held by my King","s":146.16,"e":149.04},{"t":"Daily I need you","s":150.82,"e":153.68},{"t":"More than my breath","s":154.36,"e":156.34},{"t":"More than the strength","s":157.78,"e":159.9},{"t":"I pretend that I have left. I'm sorry I leave you when I'm afraid. Teach me to stay, to stay in","s":159.9,"e":175.9},{"t":"In your presence each day, Lord, I need you.","s":175.9,"e":181.46},{"t":"Daily, I need you.","s":181.98,"e":185.84},{"t":"Search me, know me, see the secrets I conceal.","s":187.88,"e":193.1},{"t":"Break me, heal me, only you can make me real.","s":194.66,"e":200.78}